{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32259","headline":"山中与诸道友夜坐闻边防不宁因示同志 · 温庭筠","name":"山中与诸道友夜坐闻边防不宁因示同志","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"龙砂铁马犯烟尘，迹近羣鸥意倍亲。\n风卷蓬根屯戊己，月移松影守庚申。\n韬钤岂足爲经济，岩壑何尝是隐沦。\n心许故人知此意，古来知者竟谁人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32259.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32259","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}